			"notes": "This update builds upon the initial release by adding powerful, on-the-fly tools for manipulating the structure grid without opening the GUI.\n\n### What's new:\n\n*   **Added Dynamic Grid Resizing:** Look at any face of the bounding box and use the `Up/Down Arrow` keys to resize it.\n*   **Added Dynamic Grid Shifting:** Use the `V` key to nudge the entire structure area one block in the direction you are looking.\n*   **Configurable Keybinds:** All new keybinds can be remapped in the Minecraft controls menu under the \"Structure Block Unlimiter\" category.\n*   All previous features (increased size, render distance, \"Re-open Last\" keybind) are retained.\n\n### Installation:\n\nRequires NeoForge for Minecraft 1.21. Make sure to remove the old .jar file. This version must be installed on both the client and server."
		},
