			"notes": "Initial release of **Structure Block Unlimiter**!\n\nThis lightweight, vanilla-friendly mod uncaps the Structure Block, allowing you to save and render massive structures.\n\n**What's new:**\n*   Default structure size limit increased to **512x512x512**.\n*   Default render distance for the bounding box increased to **256 blocks**.\n*   Both limits are fully configurable in the `structure_block_unlimiter-common.toml` file.\n*   Added a \"Re-open Last\" keybind (default: `G`) for quick access.\n\n**Installation:** Requires NeoForge for Minecraft 1.21.1. Must be installed on both client and server."
